teams. Unbalanced forces change the motion.", "words": [{"w": "Balanced", "s": 902, "e": 916}, {"w": "forces", "s": 916, "e": 926}, {"w": "cancel,", "s": 926, "e": 939}, {"w": "like", "s": 939, "e": 946}, {"w": "a", "s": 946, "e": 950}, {"w": "tug", "s": 950, "e": 955}, {"w": "of", "s": 955, "e": 958}, {"w": "war", "s": 958, "e": 964}, {"w": "between", "s": 964, "e": 976}, {"w": "equal", "s": 976, "e": 984}, {"w": "teams.", "s": 984, "e": 998}, {"w": "Unbalanced", "s": 998, "e": 1016}, {"w": "forces", "s": 1016, "e": 1026}, {"w": "change", "s": 1026, "e": 1036}, {"w": "the", "s": 1036, "e": 1041}, {"w": "motion.", "s": 1041, "e": 1057}]}, "a4": {"pages": [[0, 9], [10, 21]], "start": 1092, "end": 1337, "speechEnd": 1313, "scene": "law1", "emotion": "fun", "text": "Back to the bus. Your body was moving with it. The bus stops, but your body keeps going. So you lurch forward!", "words": [{"w": "Back", "s": 1096, "e": 1105}, {"w": "to", "s": 1105, "e": 1109}, {"w": "the", "s": 1109, "e": 1116}, {"w": "bus.", "s": 1116, "e": 1129}, {"w": "Your", "s": 1129, "e": 1138}, {"w": "body", "s": 1138, "e": 1146}, {"w": "was", "s": 1146, "e": 1153}, {"w": "moving", "s": 1153, "e": 1166}, {"w": "with", "s": 1166, "e": 1175}, {"w": "it.", "s": 1175, "e": 1186}, {"w": "The", "s": 1186, "e": 1192}, {"w": "bus", "s": 1192, "e": 1199}, {"w": "stops,", "s": 1199, "e": 1213}, {"w": "but", "s": 1213, "e": 1219}, {"w": "your", "s": 1219, "e": 1228}, {"w": "body", "s": 1228, "e": 1237}, {"w": "keeps", "s": 1237, "e": 1248}, {"w": "going.", "s": 1248, "e": 1265}, {"w": "So", "s": 1265, "e": 1270}, {"w": "you", "s": 1270, "e": 1276}, {"w": "lurch", "s": 1276, "e": 1287}, {"w": "forward!", "s": 1287, "e": 1309}]}, "a5": {"pages": [[0, 10]], "start": 1356, "end": 1472, "speechEnd": 1472, "scene": "law1", "emotion": "definition", "text": "That is inertia: the tendency to resist any change in motion.", "words": [{"w": "That", "s": 1361, "e": 1369}, {"w": "is", "s": 1369, "e": 1373}, {"w": "inertia:", "s": 1373, "e": 1390}, {"w": "the", "s": 1390, "e": 1396}, {"w": "tendency", "s": 1396, "e": 1412}, {"w": "to", "s": 1412, "e": 1416}, {"w": "resist", "s": 1416, "e": 1427}, {"w": "any", "s": 1427, "e": 1433}, {"w": "change", "s": 1433, "e": 1445}, {"w": "in", "s": 1445, "e": 1449}, {"w": "motion.", "s": 1449, "e": 1467}]}, "a6": {"pages": [[0, 11], [12, 21], [22, 30]], "start": 1482, "end": 1854, "speechEnd": 1791, "scene": "law1", "emotion": "fun", "text": "Inertia of rest. Yank a tablecloth fast and the plates stay put. Flick the card and the coin drops into the glass. Beat a dusty carpet and the dust falls out.", "words": [{"w": "Inertia", "s": 1487, "e": 1502}, {"w": "of", "s": 1502, "e": 1506}, {"w": "rest.", "s": 1506, "e": 1522}, {"w": "Yank", "s": 1522, "e": 1530}, {"w": "a", "s": 1530, "e": 1535}, {"w": "tablecloth", "s": 1535, "e": 1556}, {"w": "fast", "s": 1556, "e": 1565}, {"w": "and", "s": 1565, "e": 1572}, {"w": "the", "s": 1572, "e": 1578}, {"w": "plates", "s": 1578, "e": 1591}, {"w": "stay", "s": 1591, "e": 1600}, {"w": "put.", "s": 1600, "e": 1613}, {"w": "Flick", "s": 1613, "e": 1624}, {"w": "the", "s": 1624, "e": 1630}, {"w": "card", "s": 1630, "e": 1639}, {"w": "and", "s": 1639, "e": 1645}, {"w": "the", "s": 1645, "e": 1652}, {"w": "coin", "s": 1652, "e": 1661}, {"w": "drops", "s": 1661, "e": 1672}, {"w": "into", "s": 1672, "e": 1680}, {"w": "the", "s": 1680, "e": 1687}, {"w": "glass.", "s": 1687, "e": 1704}, {"w": "Beat", "s": 1704, "e": 1713}, {"w": "a", "s": 1713, "e": 1717}, {"w": "dusty", "s": 1717, "e": 1728}, {"w": "carpet", "s": 1728, "e": 1741}, {"w": "and", "s": 1741, "e": 1748}, {"w": "the", "s": 1748, "e": 1754}, {"w": "dust", "s": 1754, "e": 1763}, {"w": "falls", "s": 1763, "e": 1774}, {"w": "out.", "s": 1774, "e": 1787}]}, "a7": {"pages": [[0, 13]], "start": 1864, "end": 2024, "speechEnd": 2009, "scene": "law1", "emotion": "fun", "text": "Inertia of motion. A runner keeps running a few steps after the finish line.", "words": [{"